                        <h3>Research Developer @ UIC Fall Prevention Lab</h3>
                        <p class="duration">Chicago, IL | Jan 2025 - Present</p>
                        <ul class="exp-list">
                            <li>Developed a web-based training platform to support at-home cognitive and motor rehabilitation for older adults.</li>
                            <li>Designed and implemented a Stroop-style game tailored for individuals with mild cognitive impairment.</li>
                            <li>Led a reliability study for COG-Games under the mentorship of Dr. Tanvi Bhatt and Dr. Shuaijie Wang, contributing to evidence-based game design.</li>
                        </ul>

                        <p class="tech">AWS · MediaPipe · JavaScript · MATLAB</p>
                        <a href="https://s3.us-east-2.amazonaws.com/www.fratsforfalls.com/menu.html" target="_blank">View Website</a>
