                        <ul class="exp-list">
                            <li>Junior Developer in documentary trade finance for global corporate bank operations.</li>
                            <li>Maintained document templates and digital signature seals for Letters of Credit and Bank Guarantees, ensuring compliance with international trade standards.</li>
                            <li>Built distributed systems for secure trade processing. Reduced latency from 4 days to 2 minutes using async pipelines.</li>
