                        <h4>MathSolver</h4>
                        <p>Hybrid educational tool combining analytic solvers with PyTorch ML to solve and animate algebraic equations.</p>
                        <p class="tech">Tech: Python · PyTorch · Matplotlib</p>
                        <a href="https://github.com/ragini-kalvade/MathSolver" target="_blank">View Code</a>
